 like a tsundere).\n(I would also be very happy if there is a facial expression of her smiling with a swinging smile if it is possible!\n\nAs for the color of the jersey, I like dark green, but my hair is also green,\nIf it doesn't match, I would be happy if you could make it the color you think would look good on me!\n\nI'm a green-haired person.\nX: https://x.com/hanixkami214\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@-hanixkami-\nHP: https://www.hanixkami.com/\n\n\nWe would be very happy to accept your offer!\nPlease consider us!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1O2W01md8hKTjZ0-ilZhAENcNJiNsrsSL?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@nana72710193/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1179536, "client_id": 2965620, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/55394191/uploads/origins/a814feb0-f73d-4737-890f-493b97b75ca1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1cc0f8791b239db3c68427b4f0af16e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/55394191/uploads/origins/a814feb0-f73d-4737-890f-493b97b75ca1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1cc0f8791b239db3c68427b4f0af16e, https://si.imgix.net/55394191/uploads/origins/a814feb0-f73d-4737-890f-493b97b75ca1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=931c47b34f8d1ab464d95d7289545c6f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/55394191/uploads/origins/a814feb0-f73d-4737-890f-493b97b75ca1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7eeac2a563cccc4fa0f67cf7d66365a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/55394191/uploads/origins/a814feb0-f73d-4737-890f-493b97b75ca1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4ce797b2f9f371b23c8